<title>USA: Tolland Bank board approves 4-for-3 split.</title>
<headline>Tolland Bank board approves 4-for-3 split.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON, Conn. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tolland Bank said Tuesday it approved a four-for-three common stock split, a 33.33 percent increase in the number of issued shares.</p>
<p>The stock split will be effected as a stock dividend payable on July 17, 1997 to shareholders of record July 3.</p>
